P actions make_etude
P memjob 3072000
P memory_limit 3000.0
P mode interactif
P nomjob AsterThermoElastic
P version stable
A memjeveux 2048.0
A args -max_base 300000
A tpmax 9000.0
F comm AsterThermoElasticparam.in D 1
F comm AsterThermoElastic.comm D  1
F mess AsterThermoElastic.log R  6
F mmed AsterThermoElasticinput.med D  20
F rmed AsterThermoElasticoutput.rmed R  80
F libr AsterThermoElastic_objective.csv R  27
